---
import { getLangFromUrl, useTranslations } from '../../../i18n/utils';
const lang = getLangFromUrl(Astro.url);
const t = useTranslations(lang);
// MarineValidationSection.astro
// Entity cluster: CMM + GD&T + Hydrostatic Pressure Testing + O-ring Gland Verification
---
<section class="relative py-24 overflow-hidden" style="background-color: var(--theme-bg);">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.015]">
    <svg class="w-full h-full" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><defs><pattern id="marine-hex" width="56" height="100" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><path d="M28 66L0 50L0 16L28 0L56 16L56 50L28 66L28 100" fill="none" stroke="var(--theme-primary)" stroke-width="0.5"/><path d="M28 0L28 34L0 50L0 84L28 100L56 84L56 50L28 34" fill="none" stroke="var(--theme-primary)" stroke-width="0.5"/></pattern></defs><rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#marine-hex)" /></svg>
  </div>
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center px-4 py-2 mb-4 text-sm font-semibold rounded-full border" style="background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 10%, transparent); border-color: var(--theme-primary); color: var(--theme-primary);">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 mr-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3.75 6.75h16.5M3.75 12h16.5m-16.5 5.25h16.5" /></svg>
        {t('industries.marine.validation.badge')}
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6" style="color: var(--theme-text);">
        <span style="color: var(--theme-primary);">{t('industries.marine.validation.title.main')}</span> — Hydrostatic Pressure Testing &amp; O-Ring Seal Verification
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xl max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 65%, transparent);">
        Absolute dimensional control via CMM verification per ASME Y14.5 GD&T, paired with documented hydrostatic pressure testing. Every subsea enclosure and valve block is validated against strict sealing surface criteria to guarantee zero leakage at rated depth.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
      <div class="relative rounded-xl overflow-hidden" style="background-color: var(--theme-surface); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 15%, transparent);">
        <div class="p-8">
          <div class="flex items-start mb-5">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mr-4" style="background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 10%, transparent);">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" style="color: var(--theme-primary);" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3.75 6.75h16.5M3.75 12h16.5m-16.5 5.25h16.5" /></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold" style="color: var(--theme-text);">CMM O-Ring Gland Verification</h3>
              <span class="text-sm font-medium" style="color: var(--theme-primary);">ZEISS CMM · ±1.9 µm · Seal Surface GD&T</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 60%, transparent);">
            Subsea seal integrity begins with geometrically perfect O-ring glands. Our ZEISS CMM platforms measure groove depth, width, concentricity, and surface finish — ensuring every gland meets ASME Y14.5 GD&T specifications for compression set and extrusion gap control under hydrostatic load.
          </p>
          <div class="mx-0 h-px mb-6" style="background: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 30%, transparent), transparent);"></div>
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest mb-4 block" style="color: var(--theme-primary);">Technical Implementation</span>
          <ul class="space-y-3">
            <li class="flex items-start text-sm" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 70%, transparent);"><svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 mt-0.5 mr-2 shrink-0" style="color: var(--theme-primary);" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>O-ring groove dimensions verified to ±0.01 mm — controls squeeze and extrusion gap</li>
            <li class="flex items-start text-sm" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 70%, transparent);"><svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 mt-0.5 mr-2 shrink-0" style="color: var(--theme-primary);" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>Surface finish Ra ≤ 0.8 µm on all sealing faces — prevents leak paths under compression</li>
            <li class="flex items-start text-sm" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 70%, transparent);"><svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 mt-0.5 mr-2 shrink-0" style="color: var(--theme-primary);" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>Full dimensional report per component — traceable verification for customer acceptance</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="relative rounded-xl overflow-hidden" style="background-color: var(--theme-surface); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 15%, transparent);">
        <div class="p-8">
          <div class="flex items-start mb-5">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mr-4" style="background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 10%, transparent);">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" style="color: var(--theme-primary);" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M10.125 2.25h-4.5c-.621 0-1.125.504-1.125 1.125v17.25c0 .621.504 1.125 1.125 1.125h12.75c.621 0 1.125-.504 1.125-1.125v-9M10.125 2.25h.375a9 9 0 019 9v.375M10.125 2.25A3.375 3.375 0 0113.5 5.625v1.5c0 .621.504 1.125 1.125 1.125h1.5a3.375 3.375 0 013.375 3.375M9 15l2.25 2.25L15 12" /></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold" style="color: var(--theme-text);">Hydrostatic Pressure Testing</h3>
              <span class="text-sm font-medium" style="color: var(--theme-primary);">Proof Pressure · Leak Rate · Certification</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 60%, transparent);">
            Every subsea enclosure and pressure vessel can be hydrostatically tested to 1.5× rated working pressure — with documented proof of seal integrity before deployment. Our test procedures verify zero measurable leakage across all sealing interfaces, providing the certification required for mission-critical offshore and deep-sea installations.
          </p>
          <div class="mx-0 h-px mb-6" style="background: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 30%, transparent), transparent);"></div>
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest mb-4 block" style="color: var(--theme-primary);">Technical Implementation</span>
          <ul class="space-y-3">
            <li class="flex items-start text-sm" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 70%, transparent);"><svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 mt-0.5 mr-2 shrink-0" style="color: var(--theme-primary);" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>Hydrostatic proof test to 1.5× rated pressure — documented certification provided</li>
            <li class="flex items-start text-sm" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 70%, transparent);"><svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 mt-0.5 mr-2 shrink-0" style="color: var(--theme-primary);" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>Helium leak testing available — sensitivity to < 1×10⁻⁹ mbar·L/s for critical assemblies</li>
            <li class="flex items-start text-sm" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 70%, transparent);"><svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 mt-0.5 mr-2 shrink-0" style="color: var(--theme-primary);" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>Test certificates traceable to component serial number — full QA documentation package</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-12 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3 text-sm" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 50%, transparent);">
      <span class="font-semibold" style="color: var(--theme-primary);">Entity Cluster:</span>
      <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono" style="background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 8%, transparent); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 15%, transparent);">CMM (Coordinate Measuring Machine)</span>
      <span class="text-xs">+</span>
      <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono" style="background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 8%, transparent); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 15%, transparent);">Hydrostatic Pressure Test</span>
      <span class="text-xs">+</span>
      <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono" style="background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 8%, transparent); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 15%, transparent);">O-Ring Gland GD&T</span>
      <span class="text-xs">+</span>
      <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono" style="background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 8%, transparent); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 15%, transparent);">Helium Leak Test</span>
      <span class="text-xs">+</span>
      <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono" style="background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 8%, transparent); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 15%, transparent);">ASME Y14.5</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
